dt-check-style was not properly handling DTC directives (starting with
'/', e.g. /dts-v1/ or /include/), thus a few DTS files had false
positive like:

  apm/apm-merlin.dts:1: [indent-unit-dts] indent unit must be 1 tab in DTS, got '\t\t'

