 drivers/hwtracing/coresight/coresight-tmc-etr.c | 20 +++++-----------
 drivers/hwtracing/coresight/coresight-tmc.h     |  1 +
 include/linux/coresight.h                       |  3 +++
 4 files changed, 41 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

